# python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
# Separate interpreter for the offline eval harness (requirements-eval.txt). It exists because
# ragas pulls the langchain stack; installing that into .venv alone downgrades numpy below the
# pin requirements.txt relies on. NOT matched by `.venv/` above — that pattern is exact.
.venv-eval/
# Evaluation output. Regenerated by `python -m evals.run_*`, and the RAGAS files hold full
# generated activity text that changes on every run (generation is not deterministic on any
# provider), so committing them is churn without benefit. The harness and the golden set ARE
# tracked — those are what make a result reproducible. Findings live in docs/MODEL_EVALUATION.md.
backend/evals/results/
.env
backend/.env
# node
node_modules/
dist/
frontend/.env
frontend/.vite/
# os
.DS_Store
# curriculum source PDFs + ingestion logs (Subsystem 3 — gitignored source material)
backend/data/curriculum/**/*.pdf
backend/data/curriculum/_orphans.log

# DAS cohort workbook (Subsystem 2 — gitignored source material, same reason as the curriculum
# PDFs). scripts/ingest_dial_data.py reads it from the repo root; it is not ours to redistribute.
DIAL_Anonymised_Data.xlsx

CLAUDE.md
IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md
DEMO_PLAN.md
INGESTION(1).md
# personal scratch notes (local only)
note.md
CODEBASE_SUMMARY.md
PM3_Test_Plan_UC6_UC8.md
docs/

# Fuzzing corpus — thousands of evolved input blobs, regenerable from a campaign's
# recorded seed. Noise in a diff, so not tracked.
backend/fuzz/corpus/

# Campaign console logs and raw run output. Also regenerable, also noise.
backend/fuzz/findings/*.log
backend/fuzz/findings/*.err

# The findings THEMSELVES stay tracked: the JSON summaries and the minimised reproducing
# inputs beside them are the evidence behind docs/PM_Robustness_Testing.md, and a defect
# report nobody else can replay is not a defect report.

# Playwright run output. The HTML report and traces are per-run artifacts (CI uploads them on
# failure), and playwright-results.json is the JSON reporter's summary that the frontend-e2e
# job reads to detect an all-skipped run. All three are regenerable — noise in a diff.
frontend/playwright-report/
frontend/playwright-results.json
frontend/test-results/